WEBVTT

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:33.397
that allows for guaranteed proof
of origination and ownership

00:02:33.397 --> 00:02:38.263
of music, videos, images and even text

00:02:38.297 --> 00:02:41.063
is called an NFT:

00:02:41.097 --> 00:02:42.497
non-fungible token.

00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:47.830
The NFT is allowing everyone
to own their own data,

00:02:47.863 --> 00:02:49.663
starting with art,

00:02:49.697 --> 00:02:52.530
and there is a hope
that it will revolutionize

00:02:52.563 --> 00:02:55.463
how value is created online

00:02:55.497 --> 00:02:57.830
and how digital labor is monetized.

00:02:59.163 --> 00:03:00.897
So the eternal question: